  "body": "This is not ready to merge! But I wanted to put it out there.\n\nI am starting the process of moving over to the bikeshed file, from the README. (#62). This commit has some initial work to move ReadableStream.\n\nI wanted to get this up there so we could add a comment to this PR every time we edit the README, so that I don't forget to port the changes over. Hopefully that will only happen a few times as I plan to get this done by end-of-European-day Friday.\n\nDue to a bug/feature in the CI script the latest push, no matter the branch, will override https://whatwg.github.io/streams/, so you can go check that out to see it in real life, at least until we make another commit.\n\nNeed to catch up on:\n- [x] ae0f7fe03d0020b055a30e6a7fadf17492e7ec60\n- [x] 35c60205bf00960d49d25620c9f9452f64534b97\n\nBIkeshed blockers: https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/issues/218\n",
